    "introduction": "Jonathan Cook is an actor, director, and award-winning American playwright. Many of his stage plays have been produced around the World and he's a five-time recipient of the Porter Fleming Literary Award. His short film Don't You Dare (2020) was licensed for distribution by ShortsTV network in 2021. He is also the host and writer for the podcast Gather by the Ghost Light. Launched in 2020, Gather by the Ghost Light is a collection of stage plays adapted to an audio only format performed by professional voice actors with immersive sound effects and music.",
